\f1\fs22 The Memphis Mafia didn't open till six, but by half past four when Lonnie was halfway across the staff car park out back, she already knew things were less pear-shaped than pear-quiet. The noise of Elvi at work inside, the clanging in the kitchen, the purrs of floor polishers, the jack-hammering of broken toilet bowl removal\'97all of these were not so much abnormal as completely absent.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

