\f2\i \cf2 Well, the saboteurs had certainly done their homework,
\f1\i0  Lonnie thought. She replayed the segment again, trying to make sense of it. Even watching it again for a third time\'97the file had clearly been doctored\'97Lonnie could not fully comprehend what she saw.\
The darkness transformed to stage lighting so bright, it took the software a second to adjust the picture. Then, resplendent in flowing robes, a winged angel descended out of the ceiling, carrying a couple of crates of records, and went about updating the contents of the jukebox\'92s carousel.
